WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:02,210
Because my grandparents don’t know about Yuyu yet

2
00:00:02,210 --> 00:00:05,210
But didn't you tell dad at the dinner table just now?

3
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:06,210
That's a lie to your father

4
00:00:06,210 --> 00:00:07,210
Wait until your father gets beaten with a bowl

5
00:00:07,210 --> 00:00:09,210
Mom can take Yuyu back with her

6
00:00:10,210 --> 00:00:11,690
to be beaten

7
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:23,730
Xiaojiang, right?

8
00:00:23,730 --> 00:00:24,730
Come here

9
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:28,200
I have something to tell you

10
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:33,650
Dad

11
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:34,650
You didn't open a store today?

12
00:00:34,650 --> 00:00:36,650
There's something wrong with the supermarket's store route

13
00:00:36,650 --> 00:00:37,650
The store is closed all day today

14
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:38,650
Just didn't go

15
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:40,650
Why did you suddenly come here today?

16
00:00:40,650 --> 00:00:41,650
Mom, ask you something
